capacity, through an uncovered gap, or to someone who does not fit. Heavy wind, flood, snow, saturation or structural failure suspend the relevant rating and run ordinary exposure and failure rules; no promise of dry warmth in arbitrary weather.\\\\nRun ongoing water balance, ordinary plant-material decay and structural wear on world ticks, including while the builder is absent: incoming precipitation equals runoff plus stored water plus leakage; evaporation is limited by stored water and ambient drying capacity. Persist component moisture. Add normalized joint/cover wear of 0.001 per world round, doubled while rain or wind is present; existing material decay still applies. At condition below 0.75, use measured gaps and wetness rather than the full design protection; failed load-bearing joints disable occupancy protection and create an observable collapse with recoverable components and ordinary collision/damage processing. Repair identifies defective components and consumes equivalent real replacements, one round and 1 energy per rod or metre of cord, or per 0.05 cubic metres of installed covering/bedding, rounding work up; removed material remains as explicitly degraded output. Revalidate before restoring the rating. Empty-shelter dismantling takes two rounds and 1 energy each; output only surviving component quantities with their actual moisture, decay, damage and origin. Occupied dismantling is blocked until occupants independently leave. No fresh-material refund or automatic maintenance. All prerequisites, state transitions, costs, exposure limits, conservation, failure and repair rules execute in code, not recurrent model review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":4,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Four individual study rounds teach this operation, without construction progress or automatic mastery. Requests, registration, naming, queries, waiting for development and study completion earn no pleasure or satisfaction. Leave protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions untouched. Through the existing experience system only, an actual recorded informative material test or failed structural inspection may qualify as verified information gain if it establishes a new personally applicable fact with evidence; repeat checks of the same fact do not. Actual shelter use may produce physical comfort only from measured reduced wetness or heat loss, capped at 10 total physical comfort across overlapping sources, with no benefit when already equally dry and thermally comfortable. Do not reduce basic nutrition requirements because of mood or shelter. If the established experience system supports event-linked affect, allow at most one short pleasure unit after a first personally useful completed build or successful repair, decaying to zero within five world rounds, with an 80-round cooldown shared across functionally equivalent shelter work. Modest satisfaction may be sustained only by actual useful maintenance or applicable shelter use: cap at one unit, add at most 0.04 per qualifying world round, decay by 0.002 per otherwise inactive round, and never stack equivalent shelters or count mere ownership. Familiar legitimate maintenance may qualify without novelty. These are bounded eligibility proposals for the existing experience pipeline, not direct grants or new reward accounts; where no authorized channel exists, emit the real events only and award nothing.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable inspection, material-tested, work-stage, interruption, repair, completion, leakage, wear, collapse and dismantling events with actor, project/object ID, location, tick, actual inputs/outputs, stage/progress and outcome. Persist reusable visual metadata: shelter type, footprint, orientation, ridge height, entrance geometry, component materials/colors, covered-area fraction, frame/tie condition, moisture, bedding state, occupancy and protection-active flags. Show an incomplete frame or partial thatch during construction; only successful final validation may display a completed shelter. Show actual gaps, dripping, wet bedding and broken joints as state changes, without invented occupants or emotional effects. Inspection failure or missing materials displays the failure/shortfall and retained progress, never a successful roof or protection badge. Visuals disclose only observable geometry and condition, not hidden source stock or unperformed tests.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

